From 85024c3870a071d4669f91c8d9eadc7eff421286 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:00:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/78] Port the character icon editor (H047+$00E6) and icon
 composition

Port H047+$00E6 (body $08D6) with its nested procedures $00F4, $0162,
$01EE, $02FE, $03EE and $0688: the six-state icon editor (parts,
colours, size, grid of heads or bodies by keyboard, keypad or mouse).
Also port H066+$0C34 (body $0E5A) with $0BAC, $0C42, $0D2A and
$0DEA (compose the 24x24 icon from charS/charT), H035+$01DC/$0460
(free and draw a 24x24 sprite set), H029+$10B8 (fill cells), the
BltMaskBitMapRastPort wrapper H016+$00A0 and its host emulation.
H049+$04AE and $09D6 stay stubs (combat drawing and scale > 3).

Create New Character now runs to the save question; saving (H066+$1640)
is still a stub.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013G8KST8dgGfenpqx3RukYi
